    vulkan_vm_lane_returns_exit0_after_cuda_lane_same_process_2026-08-25, 1, "2026-11-13: fail-loud half landed: VulkanVmExecutor returned ok=true for non-timeout dispatch errors (ok: not forced_timeout); now ok=false via svmg_dispatch_error_outcome. vulkan_vm_executor_dispatch_error_spec 1/2 -> 2/2, conformance spec 2/2, on release/1.0.0 35144b7f5e9 Linux aarch64 seed af717f53d6bce3e5. backends_spec 3/4: vulkan example passes after cuda in-process; cuda example fails with index 0 of empty records. Original interference not reproduced, precondition not met; row stays open."

